
                                PYTHON 2.7.18
                          NOTES ON THE AMIGA PORT

                             amigazen project


           Original Amiga port (through 2.0) by Irmen de Jong.
    Updated to Python 2.7.18 by amigazen project (continuing that work).
         (Original Python by Guido van Rossum and many others)



